==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=triplet}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A group of [[three]].
# One one of a group of three.
# One of a group of three [[sibling]]s born at the same time to the same mother.
# {{music}} A group of three [[note]]s played or written where two notes would ordinarily be; a form of [[tuplet]].
# {{physics}} A [[triquark]].

